WEBVTT

00:00:00.174 --> 00:00:02.644
What if India had two
point eight billion people?

00:00:02.724 --> 00:00:05.534
India already has more than
one point four billion.

00:00:05.685 --> 00:00:06.680
Now double it.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:07.530
First, food.

00:00:07.686 --> 00:00:11.206
India would need to produce twice
as much rice, wheat and vegetables,

00:00:11.206 --> 00:00:13.276
on the same amount of land.

00:00:13.376 --> 00:00:15.006
Then water, homes and jobs.

00:00:15.162 --> 00:00:19.162
Cities would grow into one another until
you can't tell where Delhi ends and the

00:00:19.162 --> 00:00:20.192
next city begins.

00:00:20.397 --> 00:00:21.987
Electricity demand would soar.

00:00:22.102 --> 00:00:22.542
Roads,

00:00:22.542 --> 00:00:26.832
schools and hospitals would need to double
just to keep up with today's standard.

00:00:26.878 --> 00:00:29.788
India is already the most
populous country on Earth.

00:00:29.843 --> 00:00:31.373
So what if that number doubled?

